*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% A trimmed vendor PPD in the Brother style: colour, resolution, tray and
*% media type live behind vendor option names; sizes carry dimensions.
*NickName: "Test Vendor Color Laser"
*ColorDevice: True
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize A4/A4: "          "
*PageSize Letter/Letter: "          "
*PageSize A3/A3: "          "
*PageSize Br3x5/3 x 5: "          "
*PageSize 195x270mm/16K(195x270mm): "          "
*PageSize Receipt/Receipt: "          "
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion A4/A4: "          "
*PageRegion Letter/Letter: "          "
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "12 12 583 830"
*ImageableArea Letter/Letter: "12 12 600 780"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "12 12 830 1179"
*ImageableArea Br3x5/3 x 5: "12 12 204 348"
*ImageableArea 195x270mm/16K: "12 12 541 753"
*ImageableArea Receipt/Receipt: "0 0 164 1440"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension Letter/Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "842 1191"
*PaperDimension Br3x5/3 x 5: "216 360"
*PaperDimension 195x270mm/16K: "553 765"
*PaperDimension Receipt/Receipt: "164 1440"
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize [5 -2 roll] /ImagingBBox null>> setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 100 842
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 100 1440
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0
*OpenUI *Duplex/Two-Sided: PickOne
*DefaultDuplex: None
*Duplex None/Off: "          "
*Duplex DuplexNoTumble/Long-Edge: "          "
*Duplex DuplexTumble/Short-Edge: "          "
*CloseUI: *Duplex
*OpenUI *BRInputSlot/Paper Source: PickOne
*DefaultBRInputSlot: Auto
*BRInputSlot Auto/Auto: "          "
*BRInputSlot Tray1/Tray 1: "          "
*BRInputSlot Manual/Manual: "          "
*CloseUI: *BRInputSlot
*OpenUI *BRResolution/Print Quality: PickOne
*DefaultBRResolution: 600dpi
*BRResolution 600dpi/Normal: "          "
*BRResolution 600x2400dpi/Fine: "          "
*CloseUI: *BRResolution
*OpenUI *BRMonoColor/Color / Mono: PickOne
*DefaultBRMonoColor: Auto
*BRMonoColor Auto/Auto: "          "
*BRMonoColor FullColor/Color: "          "
*BRMonoColor Mono/Mono: "          "
*CloseUI: *BRMonoColor
*OpenUI *BRMediaType/Media Type: PickOne
*DefaultBRMediaType: Plain
*BRMediaType Plain/Plain Paper: "          "
*BRMediaType Thick/Thick Paper: "          "
*CloseUI: *BRMediaType
